          "coq9_functional_roles: YALI1E18269g: COQ7-family demethoxyubiquinone hydroxylase candidate; YALI1F34675g: COQ9-family lipid-binding/substrate-presentation auxiliary candidate. Native established symbols and biochemical localization unverified.",
